                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really good stuff. Once you get the ability to start recruiting orcs and attacking fortresses, the game really hits its stride, mixing the nemesis system with some light sandbox battle elements. I especially like making orcs fight each other in the fighting pits or sending captains to fight each other and seeing how it plays out. Possibly my favorite part is when I'm defending a fortress and my overlord gets summoned, and I get to chant with the orcs \"UR-BENU! UR-BENU!\" It really is a shame the nemesis system is patented and collecting dust.",
